Z||000000||BroCar 87||12-01-2000||03:46 AM||||Not trying to be mean here or anything, but why has there been quite a few posts on the MR2 drivers becoming members here. I mean, the topics say FIERO in them, not MR2. Sure, the MR2's are simular to the Fiero's but still... Isn't this the FIERO FORUM? Don't they have a MR2 forum somewhere out there too?<BR>Please, I don't mean to flame here and don't wanna get flamed back, I am just wondering why the sudden increase in MR2's on our forum.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Signature2.jpg">  <BR>87 Coupe "IRON BEAST"<BR>   Custom dual side exit exhaust!||||reg||4
Z||000001||RossT||12-01-2000||04:01 AM||||Bro, My first reaction was like yours, but I have changed my mind and kind of like it.  They give us all something to think about. Some of the forum members have made new friends. It also looks like the MR2 people have become more interested in our cars, rather than bashing them. The forum is learning tool for fiero owners and non fiero owners. Who knows, some of these guys may even purchase a fiero sometime.  Anyway, I thinks its ok, but I do understand where your coming from.<P>Ross||||reg||1
Z||000002||Jake||12-01-2000||04:35 AM||||well, they dont really ramble about their cars uless asked about em. I don't have a problem with the MR2 folks. Mr2's are kinda cool actually. Yes, this is meant as a Fiero forum, and it still is a Fiero forum. It's just got friends now  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||Tigger||12-01-2000||09:01 AM|||| <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004539.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/004539.html</A> <P>Here's the thread that sorta started it all.  So far the guys that have ventured from the MR2 forum have an interest in Fieros too.<P>------------------<BR>T-T-F-N, Tah Tah For Now!<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tiggerblue2.gif"> ||||reg||1
