Z||000010||Fiero5||12-01-2000||06:47 PM||||I don't mind at all, as long as they keep it Fiero related in the appropriate places on the Forum. I believe the Forum is for anyone and everyone who likes Fieros, whether they  own one or not. If someone came on the Forum and had a clunker of a car, and wanted to join in with us, I don't think anyone would think twice. But due to the rivalry during the original production and the reviews of the Fiero and the MR2, many still harbor ill thoughts towards those "other" sporty cars.<P>Who knows, maybe they will like what they see and hear on the Forum over time and get converted. Wouldn't that be a feather in Cliff's and everyone else hat here on the Forum!<P>------------------<BR>                                                                                                                                                                                     <IMG SRC="http://irving.about.com/library/graphics/funny.gif"> ||||reg||1
