Z||000023||Jake||12-02-2000||10:48 PM||||VelociFero, I'll be the first to admit it. My Rx-7 is NOT reliable. It's actually broke down right now  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Seemed to have a problem with starting. Acted like it was loading up. So I was pulling the spark plugs out and I got to the last one. The other 3 were soaked with gas like I figured, but when I was pulling the last one out I was thinking to myself "man, this one must be really bad, My fingers are getting wet" Pulled it out all the way and watched antifreeze fall on the ground. It was pretty funny actually. A friend was there and he yelled "head gasket!" I was like "what head?"  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Oh well...Sh#t happens||||reg||10
