Z||000026||Carrolles||12-03-2000||01:49 PM||||I think it's great to hear from other enthusiasts as long as we all can stay friendly and not get to flaming each other.<P>I love my Fieros but I also love many other cars.  I really enjoyed my Fiat X/19 even with its very tight engine compartment.  The jack shaft for the bottom mounted A/C compressor was a site to see.  My 66 big block 4spd Vette was a blast and my Triumph Spitfires were fun to drive.<P>I do enjoy the Fieros the most though.  They are greatly undervalued for now which allows me to have more than one.||||reg||1
